KJV: Samuel, Shemuel.

H8051.definition:
from H8074 (שָׁמֵם); renowned;
Shammua, the name of four Israelites
KJV: Shammua, Shammuah.

H8052.definition:
feminine passive participle of H8074 (שָׁמֵם);
something heard, i.e. an announcement
KJV: bruit, doctrine, fame, mentioned, news, report, rumor, tidings.

H8053.definition:
passive participle of H8103 (שִׁמְצָה); observed;
