KJV: Shema.

H8088.definition:
from H8085 (שָׁמַע);
something heard, i.e. a sound, rumor, announcement; abstractly, audience
KJV: bruit, fame, hear(-ing), loud, report, speech, tidings.

H8089.definition:
from H8085 (שָׁמַע);
a report
KJV: fame.

H8090.definition:
for H8087 (שֶׁמַע);
Shema, a place in Palestine
KJV: Shema.

H8091.definition:
from H8085 (שָׁמַע); obedient;
Shama, an Israelite
